{"nodeId":"kp:21175","contents":[],"requirements":{"knowledgeRequirement":{"value":"在简单实际情境中选择抽样方法和恰当统计图表，结合实例用样本估计总体的集中趋势与离散程度。","originalWording":"在简单的实际情境中，能根据实际问题的特点，设计恰当的抽样方法解决问题。\n能根据实际问题的特点，选择恰当的统计图表 （如频数分布直方图、频率分布直方图、散点图等）对数据进行可视化描述，体会合理使用统计图表的重要性。\n①结合实例，能用样本估计总体的集中趋势参数 （平均数、中位数、众数），理解集中趋势参数的统计含义。\n②结合实例，能用样本估计总体的离散程度参数 （标准差、方差、极差），理解离散程度参数的统计含义。","scope":"必修课程本条目内容对应：必修统计应用SKILL中的抽样方法选择、统计图表和两类样本估计；仅对应所列部分，不表示其他课程类别的全员要求、学生达成或学业质量等级","status":"verified","sourceId":"S2025-PDF","sourceEdition":"2017年版2025年修订（日常修订版）","evidence":[{"id":"ev:S2025:S24:S3","sourceId":"S2025-PDF","sourceTitle":"2025数学课程标准（日常修订版）","sourceSha256":"fc9258bb37ed2e052a4b1be608865a5481f770ae7e28ce536e835d2354353f86","sourceStatus":"original_source_identity_preserved","locator":{"part":"pdf","pdfPage":34,"printedPage":31,"headingPath":["必修课程","主题四 概率与统计","内容要求","统计","抽样方法的选择"],"physicalTextLinesOneBased":[866,867]},"quote":"在简单的实际情境中，能根据实际问题的特点，设计恰当的抽样方法解决问题。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":false,"resource":{"url":"r80/assets/3c9b3f289b099124629abaa8.png","kind":"existing_local_original_pdf_page_preview","sha256":"3c9b3f289b099124629abaa81fee1bddd6222f7dbad48beadda666e1738e714e","bytes":336539,"sourceId":"S2025-PDF","sourceSha256":"fc9258bb37ed2e052a4b1be608865a5481f770ae7e28ce536e835d2354353f86","localOrigin":"/Users/yichen.zhang/vibe coding/codex/projects/数学教育平台/math-network-site/r80/assets/3c9b3f289b099124629abaa8.png","requestedPath":"S2025-PDF PDF page34 / printed31","pdfPage":34,"printedPage":31},"originalPdfUrl":"source-original/S2025-PDF.pdf","originalUrl":"source-original/S2025-PDF.pdf","verificationScope":"必修课程 complete original content clause, finite covered aspect; course category/optional-exam boundaries retained, no achievement or level inference.","sourceClauseId":"S3"},{"id":"ev:S2025:S24:S4","sourceId":"S2025-PDF","sourceTitle":"2025数学课程标准（日常修订版）","sourceSha256":"fc9258bb37ed2e052a4b1be608865a5481f770ae7e28ce536e835d2354353f86","sourceStatus":"original_source_identi